WEBVTT

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.579
this assembly is going to take
more than one person

00:12:30.621 --> 00:12:31.872
or group of people.

00:12:31.872 --> 00:12:33.499
It's going to take everyone.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:35.209
Are you ready? Should we dive in?

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:36.460
Let's do it.

00:12:36.835 --> 00:12:38.045
Up first,

00:12:38.086 --> 00:12:40.422
don't weaponize gratitude.

00:12:41.048 --> 00:12:43.926
Now, don't get me wrong,
gratitude is a great word.

00:12:43.967 --> 00:12:47.679
It's nice, it's fluffy,
a solid 11 points in Scrabble.

00:12:48.806 --> 00:12:50.057
However, let's be clear.

00:12:50.057 --> 00:12:52.518
Although gratitude feels warm and fuzzy,

00:12:52.518 --> 00:12:54.728
it's not a form of currency.

00:12:55.437 --> 00:12:58.106
Women are assigned 10 percent more work

00:12:58.106 --> 00:13:00.442
and spend more time on unrewarded,